WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:04.090
Welcome to Module 13 of the
Non-Person Identity learning path:

2
00:00:04.090 --> 00:00:06.862
run the managed service account standard.

3
00:00:06.862 --> 00:00:10.760
It teaches the standard in the
companion guide Service Accounts,

4
00:00:10.760 --> 00:00:13.287
with Chapter 12 of the developer workbook.

5
00:00:13.287 --> 00:00:15.937
Module 12 moved one account by hand.

6
00:00:15.937 --> 00:00:21.821
This module is about every account after
that: how a G M S A is asked for, approved,

7
00:00:21.821 --> 00:00:26.417
created, watched, attested and
retired the same way each time,

8
00:00:26.417 --> 00:00:28.163
with the same evidence.

9
00:00:28.163 --> 00:00:30.820
Take it after Modules 8 and 12.
